<title>GERMANY: Helaba Q1 oper profit before provs higher.</title>
<headline>Helaba Q1 oper profit before provs higher.</headline>
<dateline>FRANKFURT 1997-05-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Three months to March 31</p>
<p>(in millions of marks unless otherwise stated)</p>
<p>    Group oper profit before provisions   138.7  up 18.2 pct</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name of the German bank is Landesbank Hessen-Thueringen Girozentrale. The comparison is with one quarter of the total 1996 profit, rather than on a straight period-for-period comparison.</p>
<p>--Frankfurt Newsroom +49 69 756525</p>
